<Base lang="en" title="Writing"><article class="prose"><p class="label">Writing</p><h1>The words arrive before the biography.</h1><p>Selected fiction, essays, and fragments will live here. Chinese is the natural home of the originals; English pages will offer author’s notes, context, and carefully selected translations—not hurried machine versions of every piece.</p><aside class="note">The first texts are still being edited and cleared for publication. Private files and unselected drafts are never synced here.</aside></article></Base>
